WEBVTT

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.640
So that's what happened.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:05.000
I see.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.770
So Mea-chan and the others headed there to stop Yami-chan, then.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.260
Darkness...

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.790
I can't believe something like that happened with us unaware of it.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:14.720
That's right.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.030
This is the first time the two of you have even heard about the relationship between Yami-chan and Tear, right?

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:20.140
You must have been surprised.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.060
Not really.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.360
It's actually somehow easy to believe.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:25.750
The resemblance is too much to be a coincidence.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:32.590
It seems Lala-san and the others managed to ward off that enormous sword earlier.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.090
But if that happens again...

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:38.420
It's okay.

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:42.930
Yami-chan definitely will not destroy this town.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:47.940
We all believe that she isn't that type of person.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.780
Yami-chan will surely come back.

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:54.380
Yuuki-kun and the others will bring her back!

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.620
Thank you.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:01.110
She's... not alone anymore, is she?

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:04.410
I have to believe, too.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.790
Yes, just like that, Senpai.

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:14.240
That's the method to stimulate the bug and awaken Yami-san's heart.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.800
To Yami-san, it's an impossibility.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.260
In other words, instead of the usual act of God,

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:24.270
Rito-san perpetrating shameless acts of his own will!

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:30.270
To become shameless of his own free will be difficult for a sincere person like Rito-san.

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:35.010
What's more, he has to come into
contact with Darkness at zero distance.

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:38.490
If Yami attacks, Momo and I will stop her.

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:40.960
I'm opposed to you being a beast,

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:42.470
but I'll make an exception just for today.

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:44.500
Make absolutely sure you wake up Yami, Rito!

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:49.580
If Senpai dies, this planet goes with him.

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:52.090
I believe in you, Rito-senpai!

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:56.590
Your shamelessness will save the world, Senpai!

