Certainly, that's the type of person Rito-san is.

00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:10.720
That's exactly why we have this plan!

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:15.940
The problem is whether Rito-san is able to do it.

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:24.320
I'm going to do it!

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.880
I don't know what it is that you're planning,

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.080
but I'm happy that you're coming closer to me.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:32.230
I can finally kill you.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:35.920
Cloud!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.920
Cannon Flower!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.270
Rito-san!

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:48.890
Now!

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:04.530
Rito-san, that's what you usually do, that's not the right way!

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:06.500
Yami...

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:11.790
Was the Taiyaki Miso Soup tasty?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:18.250
When I see Mikan... I feel warm.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.250
Everyone at school, as well.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.000
I...

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:25.740
I cannot become happy.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.220
That's what I think.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.770
Please don't get carried away.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:32.640
That's not something I would talk about to you, who is my target.

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:36.890
Just kidding.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:57.620
Yami-chan!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.960
Ah! Hey-! What?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.070
What's with him?

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:02.870
He took off his clothes.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:04.590
It's just like the Principal. {timing check this and previous please!}{timing is right}

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:05.720
I see!

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:09.190
The principal has gone after Yami-san countless times!

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:10.840
He's a pervert among perverts!

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:13.320
Using the principal as an image,

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:16.850
Rito-san is trying to break through the wall of his reason!

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.580
H-He's...

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:29.110
The naive, late-blooming Rito-san is...!

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:32.070
Doing shameless things of his own free will!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:35.330
Ah! I can't believe I'm doing this!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:36.210
No, no!

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.620
I can't become reasonable!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.710
I'm a pervert, a pervert!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:44.710
Rito-senpai is desperately holding
himself back for Yami-oneechan's sake!

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:48.270
Yami-chan!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.270
He's playing the part of an impossible self!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.340
How?!

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:58.180
Doing something like this willingly!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.940
This can't be possible for Yuuki Rito!

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:08.480
No!

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:10.040
You beast...

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:13.450
That technique has been cultivated at night.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:17.950
Even though Rito-san was unaware, his body moved!

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.460
As I thought, he has the nature of a harem king!

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:22.790
Yami-chan!

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.340
Yami-chan!

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:27.250
This...

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:32.910
This... isn't Yuuki Rito!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.460
What is this..?

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:36.590
Who is this...?

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:38.580
I don't understand.

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.500
I...

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:45.020
Who am I...?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.680
I won't let you get away!

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:52.360
Yami-chan!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.510
Yami, wake up!

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:58.890
You're supposed to get angry when something perverted like this happens to you!

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:01.690
You're supposed to say those words!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.460
We have to follow them!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.670
Yeah!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:09.670
Mea!

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.280
Yami-oneechan...

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:12.660
Rito-senpai...

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.580
Squeeze, squeeze!

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:23.190
It's flowing into me... Yami-oneechan's heart.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:25.700
I see.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.790
So this is the cause of the bug.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:32.360
The identity of the one feeling that Darkness couldn't control!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:38.870
Um... Could it be... You want this?

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.370
You'll definitely be hurt by this later Yami, so...

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:52.010
At the very least, what you've done since coming to Earth has been good for Mikan and yourself.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.000
If Tearju-sensei had been by your side,

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.640
you might have lived a different life, Yami!

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:08.400
That's because... I want you to become happy.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.800
Yami-oneechan...

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.810
Rito-senpai... You...

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:38.570
Squishy!

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:40.120
Squishy, squishy!

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:43.150
Yami-chan!

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:51.650
How long are you going to keep doing that?

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:58.450
I hate perverted things!

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.360
Yami...

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.290
The horns...

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.550
Darkness' horns are gone!

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:08.040
You did it, Rito-san!

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.670
Good morning, Yami-oneechan.

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:15.560
Mea...

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.930
I...

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.430
This town... I nearly...

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:26.070
I-It's okay!

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:27.640
The town is safe.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:31.280
I think you should apologise to the people you caused problems for, though.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.190
But that's all there is to it!

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.270
Huh?

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:44.030
Rito, you're home?

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:47.030
It looks like something's going on in town.

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:48.870
I think something's happening with Yami-san-

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:56.930
What are you two doing,  looking like perverts like that...?

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:57.970
It's a misunderstanding, Mikan!

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.090
Y-Yeah, that's right!

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.340
There's a reason for this!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.890
I-I can explain...

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.470
Hey! Rito!

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:23.730
Oh, my.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.780
It's the usual again...

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:27.970
Ouch...

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:32.500
I-I'm sorry, Nana! {Yes, he mistakes her for Nana because of her flat chest. LOL}

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.840
Wait, why are you like that after a shower?!

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:38.380
Sorry about that, Rito!

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.810
Lala!

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:40.650
Hey.

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:43.270
What made you mistake her for me?

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:52.380
I can't believe that yesterday was the Earth's greatest crisis...

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:57.770
A lot happened, but we managed to avoid it and now we've returned to the normal everyday life, Mikan-san.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.630
You seem to be awfully at ease.

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:02.060
The Earth was nearly cut in half, you know?

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:03.780
Well, that's true.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:08.330
So that light was trans after all.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:10.030
Thanks for the meal!

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:10.840
Come on, Rito!

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:13.080
We'll be late for school!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.130
Hey, Lala!

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.830
You're going to go like that?

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.320
Of course!

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.430
Peke, please!

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:19.160
Yes!

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:20.760
Your school uniform, right?

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:35.190
I made a few changes to match your appearance.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.040
As expected!

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:40.360
See you later, Mikan!

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:43.370
Don't push yourself too much, Lala-san!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.200
Is she really okay?

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:50.500
Yami-san, too.

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:53.870
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:56.030
I caused you all trouble.

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:57.190
I'm sorry.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.510
I'm sorry.

00:12:58.510 --> 00:12:59.630
It was my fault.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.380
It's fine, it's fine.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.380
I'm just glad you returned to yourself, Yami-chan.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:10.650
Yami-oneechan, Lala-senpai is here! {more like Loli-senpai now :D}

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:18.200
Oh...

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.950
Yami-chan, what is this?

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:23.360
This is a show of my apology to you, Princess.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:28.030
I caused an especially heavy burden to you, so much so that it caused you to shrink,

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:30.260
so please drink lots and grow big again.

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:32.240
Yes! Thank you!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:35.160
Ah! But you don't need to worry about it that much, okay?

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:35.750
Huh?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:40.060
In short, I only used up all of my energy temporarily,

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:44.260
so if I eat and sleep properly every
day I'll return to normal eventually.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:51.010
Compared to my father who shrunk all the way to a baby in the Galactic War, it's no big deal.

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.510
Is that so...?

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.220
I'm glad if that's the case.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:59.560
I did perverted things to you two as well...

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.380
Don't worry about it, Yami-chan.

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:05.400
Because of the circumstances, I won't say anything harsh.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.520
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:08.360
Yami-chan!

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:11.370
This is the first time I've seen Yami-chan like this...

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:14.900
So she is worried about what happened yesterday, after all...

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:19.150
Ah, I wanted to see the perverted Yami-Yami, too!

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:20.570
Yeah, yeah!

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:23.670
You could have involved us, as well!

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:27.140
Shameless!

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:31.850
I hate perverted things.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.420
We were rejected.

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:34.600
That's too bad.

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.520
I'm the only one she ignores?

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:55.790
So she is mad about yesterday, as I thought.

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:06.800
How have you been physically since then?

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:11.380
Have there been any after-effects from using trans so much?

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:12.910
There have been no problems.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:15.010
In fact, I feel good.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:19.350
So in the end I guess you could say it was a demonstration of your ultimate power.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.400
Yami-chan...

00:15:22.890 --> 00:15:24.750
I'm so glad!

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:27.120
You returned to normal!

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.650
Tear, please don't get your snot on me.

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.800
It was thanks to everyone, wasn't it?

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:35.400
I'm so glad!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:43.840
Even though you're her creator, you were no use at all.

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:47.880
That's because I was removed from the project partway through...!

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:53.290
Is this really okay...?

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:55.930
The place I love...

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.390
This town...

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:00.200
This Earth.. I nearly...

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:01.810
Yami-san!

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:04.430
Mikan?

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:08.070
I see.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:10.730
So you've been apologising all day today, huh?

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.130
It must have been hard.

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.030
No.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:14.980
Those are the seeds that I sowed.

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:19.040
I feel kind of bad that I wasn't there during the most crucial time.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:23.300
No, I'm glad it ended without anything bad happening to you.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.590
This is {an opinion based on }hindsight, but...

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:30.590
If I made one mistake, I would have...

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.140
We managed to avoid it and now we're back to ordinary life.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.260
That's what Momo-san said.

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:49.820
We're able to eat taiyaki together again, so it's fine, isn't it?

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:03.130
Huh?

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.240
Are you going already?

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:05.080
Yes.

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:10.150
I still haven't finished expressing my gratitude for being able to return to this everyday life.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.400
I'll be going home, now!

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:17.430
Rito-dono!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.850
There's still lots I want to ask you about!

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:23.310
Good grief...

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:27.770
Zastin and the others are persistent at asking me about yesterday...

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:30.740
"How specifically did you return Yami to normal"?

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.190
How could I explain something like that?

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:37.680
It seems Momo explained it to Haruna-chan and the others softly,

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:41.200
but I didn't really ask about that in detail.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.660
Is she being considerate for me?

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:47.670
Having done something like that...

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.700
I feel incredibly guilty...

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:54.850
Yami!

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:15.540
Yuuki Rito...

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:24.830
If not for you, I would have...

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:30.580
Yesterday, um...

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:32.530
I have to say it!

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:42.890
Th-Th-Tha-Th-...

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:50.650
Thank-

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:50.650
I'm sorry!

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:58.850
Yesterday I did lots of perverted things to you.

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:00.600
Like... Your butt.

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:01.710
Eh!?

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:03.490
And your boobs!

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.960
I squeezed and rubbed various places!

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:10.000
B-But I did it for your sake-

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.790
That's enough of that!

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:12.920
Please be quiet!

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:25.430
Wha-!?

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:29.560
Why does it always turn into that right away?!

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:31.960
I'll say this so you don't misunderstand.

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:37.410
Everything I said and did when Darkness was activated wasn't the real me!

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:45.530
I-I'm not that perverted, and I don't think anything of you!

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:50.410
So, um... About yesterday...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:53.790
Wai-!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.710
Don't you go and die by yourself, that would be a problem!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.790
Because you're my target!

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:58.580
Tea!

00:19:58.580 --> 00:19:59.920
That's it! A vending machine!

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:04.250
Ah, she's so flustered.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:07.010
Yami-oneechan is so dishonest.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:10.510
Does this mean I should help out with this, too?

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.000
Good grief...

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.600
What a disappointing turn of events.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:15.550
Ah.

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:23.320
If Darkness had been released properly, the universe would have fallen into chaos, and a new Galactic War would have started.

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:24.930
Neme-chan!

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:29.730
It may have changed into a place where we weapons could belong.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:35.230
Are you really okay with how it turned out, Mea?

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:35.960
Yeah.

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.520
It's fine as it is.

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:39.430
Because now I understand, too.

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:43.630
The midst of battle is not the only place a weapon can belong.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:48.760
In other words, I think I can do it in this town.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.680
How boring.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:55.550
Now I've lost one of my dear manservants.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.340
Well, it's fine though.

00:20:58.340 --> 00:20:59.870
I still have another manservant, after all.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:00.870
Neme-chan!

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:03.560
Why don't you live in this town too, Neme-chan?

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:06.850
Don't worry, I'm not going anywhere.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:11.150
I'll always be watching over Yami and you from the shadows.

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:16.080
After all, this is my way of killing time.

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:26.840
H-Huh? Yami?

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:40.360
I hate perverted things.

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:48.450
Big sister, are you okay?

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:50.120
All done!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.250
Yes, yes.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:55.910
Rito sure is late, though.

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.710
It looks like he's getting along fine with Yami-san, doesn't it?

00:21:58.710 --> 00:21:59.500
Eh?

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:03.630
Now for our next story.

