00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:28.240
<b>庭先揺れる花がツンと背伸びで応える</b>

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:28.240
<b>The flower swaying in the garden answers by stretching up</b>

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:33.870
<b>tsumasakidachi de asa ni ohayou no kisu</b>

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:33.870
<b>つま先立ちで朝におはようのKiss</b>

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:33.870
<b>To give a good morning kiss standing on tiptoes</b>

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:36.790
<b>saa yukou</b>

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:36.790
<b>さあ行こう</b>

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:36.790
<b>Now let's go!</b>

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.590
<b>fui ni tsumujikaze omowazu shagamikomu</b>

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.590
<b>不意につむじ風思わずしゃがみ込む</b>

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.590
<b>Caught off guard by the sudden whirlwind, I reflexively crouch down</b>

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:55.890
<b>fuwari sukaato ni kakushita yowasatsuyoku haratte miseta</b>

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:55.890
<b>ふわりスカートに隠した弱さ 強く払ってみせた</b>

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:55.890
<b>I firmly brush off the weakness hidden inside my skirt</b>

00:22:56.770 --> 00:23:04.940
<b>fuzoroi de sainan na nichijou ni sakihokorou</b>

00:22:56.770 --> 00:23:04.940
<b>不揃いで災難な日常に咲き誇ろう</b>

00:22:56.770 --> 00:23:04.940
<b>Let's bloom to our fullest in this strange everyday life full of misfortune</b>

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:13.120
<b>sunao ni sodatanai kara chanto mitenakucha</b>

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:13.120
<b>素直に育たないからちゃんと見てなくちゃ</b>

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:13.120
<b>I can't be honest, so you have to pay close attention</b>

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:21.120
<b>tameratta ano omoi sotto tsuchi ni umetanda</b>

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:21.120
<b>躊躇ったあの想いそっと土に埋めたんだ</b>

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:21.120
<b>I carefully buried the memory of my hesitance in the soil</b>

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:27.380
<b>A flower blooming in your heart</b>

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:32.680
<b>sono hi o yume mite</b>

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:32.680
<b>その日を夢見て</b>

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:32.680
<b>I dream of that day</b>
